      "text": "1. GIVEN CIRCUMSTANCES\n   All the facts of the play: time, place, events preceding\n   the play, social relationships, historical context.\n   The given circumstances are the environment within which\n   the character makes choices.\n   Like: the constraints of a problem before solving it."
